{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06993","headline":"送沈芳谒李观察求仕进 · 周万","name":"送沈芳谒李观察求仕进","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往日长安路，欢游不惜年。\n爲贪卢女曲，用尽沈郎钱。\n身老方投刺，途穷始着鞭。\n犹闻有知己，此去不徒然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周万","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}